<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.mandate.lands ~ mandate ~ the carrier the house starts an arm under

`lares spirit mandate <pet>#<n>` lands the mandate words (`file=<path|->` or `text=<words>`) as one record keyed by its own hash, so the same mandate twice finds itself standing; a framed carrier founds its family instead. The launch affordances ride as fields, each where no carrier meta names it: `model=`, `cap=` (the launch cap), `allowed-tools=`, `workdir=`, `log=`, `reads=`, `links=`, `paths=`, `caps=`, `grants=`, `lanes=` (the arm-lane ceiling), `handback=` (the hand-back shape). A coordinator names its own mandate by `parent= <uri>@<hash>`; with none, the offerer reads as the hand. The answer hands back the summon line.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ land

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`land` params=`pet/ferry-read#1 file/mandate.md cap/claude ~ land the mandate and print the summon line`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face · pet · file · text · parent · lanes · model · cap · allowed-tools · workdir · log · reads · links · paths · caps · grants · handback

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`pet` params=`takes/instance-tag needs/required seat/1 as/<pet> ~ the instance tag, <pet>#<n>`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/host-path ~ the mandate from a host file, or - for stdin`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`text` params=`takes/words ~ the mandate as words`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`parent` params=`takes/ref ~ the coordinator's mandate, <uri>@<hash>`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`lanes` params=`takes/count ~ the arm-lane ceiling`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`model` params=`takes/model ~ the model the launch names`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`cap` params=`takes/cap ~ the launch cap`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`allowed-tools` params=`takes/list ~ the tools the launch allows`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`workdir` params=`takes/host-path ~ the launch's working directory`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`log` params=`takes/host-path ~ an absolute file the instance's stream lands in`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`reads` params=`takes/list ~ what the instance reads`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`links` params=`takes/list ~ the links it follows`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`paths` params=`takes/list ~ the paths it reaches`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`caps` params=`takes/list ~ the caps it holds`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`grants` params=`takes/list ~ the grants it carries`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`handback` params=`takes/shape ~ the hand-back shape it owes`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ocap/write-on-the-daemon-wiki ~ a seat names its coordinator's mandate; the tiddler door gates the put`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · spirit-secret-shaped · mandate-malformed · mandate-model-malformed · mandate-allowed-tools-malformed · mandate-path-malformed · launch-cap-unknown · mandate-unknown · mandate-moved · spirit-write-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.mandate.lands pet/ferry-read#1 file/mandate.md]] ~ no tag, no words, two sources, a malformed lanes or parent, or a seat with no parent`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-secret-shaped` params=`~ the words or an affordance hold secret-shaped strings`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`mandate-malformed` params=`~ the mandate reads malformed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`mandate-model-malformed` params=`~ the model names no model`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`mandate-allowed-tools-malformed` params=`~ the allowed tools read malformed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`mandate-path-malformed` params=`~ a path reads malformed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`launch-cap-unknown` params=`~ the launch cap names no cap the house knows`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`mandate-unknown` params=`~ the parent names no mandate`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`mandate-moved` params=`~ the parent reads another hash`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-write-refused` params=`~ the tiddler door answered no put`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

